Description:

The "category" comparator of Email/query now also supports filter conditions
that are indexed in Xapian, as long as they do not match message bodies.
The "text", "body" and "attachmentBody" conditions stay unsupported.


Documentation:

None


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

The "messageId", "references" and "inReplyTo" conditions require a Xapian
index of version 17 or higher. A category sort that groups by one of them
is rejected on an older index. Reindexing with squatter fixes this.


